WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.000
First, find one whole strip. Count its large outlined pieces. Keep the little bumps out of your count.

2
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:20.000
There are six equal large pieces. Write six at the bottom of the fraction.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Now count only the green large pieces. There are two. Write two at the top.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Two green pieces out of six equal pieces. That is two sixths, written two over six.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Try this picture. Four large pieces are green. The whole still has six equal pieces. That is four sixths.
